#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:1
#: ed6a79fd1e1c4b74bad8b120b3c25a7f
msgid "训练集评估"
msgstr "Training Set Audit"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:3
#: 6699bedd19ba4fbe95b17c97b4e01057
msgid ""
"「训练集评估」用于检查当前训练数据：先找会阻止训练的技术问题，再查看组分、标签、局域环境、结构相和磁类型在数据内部如何分布。每一项结果都能回到 `NEP "
"Dataset Display` 中的原始结构，便于继续查看、选择或导出。"
msgstr ""
"Training Set Audit inspects the active training data in two stages: it first"
" finds technical problems that can block training, then shows how "
"composition, labels, local environments, structural phases, and magnetic "
"types are distributed within the dataset. Every result keeps the original "
"structure indices so that you can return to `NEP Dataset Display` to "
"inspect, select, or export the affected structures."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:5
#: cdfe8de8ee3f4eecb2299ddc67ffdd35
msgid "这个页面给出的是**当前数据快照的证据**。它不会仅凭一份训练集宣称物理空间已经完整覆盖，也不会在缺少独立测试数据时判断势函数是否可靠。"
msgstr ""
"This page reports **evidence from the current dataset snapshot**. A training"
" set alone cannot prove complete coverage of physical space, and model "
"reliability cannot be established without independent test data."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:7
#: 61b50b66a79641f58e7994c0074098c3
msgid "从 `NEP Dataset Display` 进入"
msgstr "Open the audit from `NEP Dataset Display`"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:9
#: 08bd3645102a4cd1809c6981fbbfab3c
msgid "先在 `NEP Dataset Display` 中打开训练数据，再使用以下任一入口："
msgstr "Load the training data in `NEP Dataset Display`, then use either entry point:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md b5b0e16e6e5544fe93ad6cdaecbade8b
msgid "入口"
msgstr "Entry point"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md a66e604d54b34c95adb49d063bdb09ef
msgid "打开位置"
msgstr "Opens"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md e9c698fc627c4f2286cd80b11b74e9c8
msgid "适合做什么"
msgstr "Use it for"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md 2301673faa294843a3637d89f1fb1232
msgid "顶部 `Save` 分裂菜单 → `评估当前数据集`"
msgstr "Title-bar `Save` split menu → `Check current dataset`"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md 582ecc1ba7bd4fc191db7518820b9f47
msgid "训练集评估的「概览」"
msgstr "Training Set Audit → `Overview`"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md 3521d2ccdd0e4997b0c8490ad2817e98
msgid "完整检查当前活动结构"
msgstr "Run the complete audit on the active structures"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md 3471d396a4c34b0db5814449a2e685fb
msgid "左侧图表工具栏 → `查看数据分布`"
msgstr "Plot toolbar → `Explore distributions`"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md 6df085e7882940b29852ad79d47d166d
msgid "「数据地图」→「数据分布」"
msgstr "`Data map` → `Data distribution`"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md 9086731d725e4f679e91f37d830d421d
msgid "直接查看能量、力、virial、预测值或误差的分布"
msgstr "Inspect distributions of energy, force, virial, predictions, or errors"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:16
#: 7c4b6b3e885249f6b64dd5155fc37630
msgid "没有加载数据时，入口会提示先打开数据集。评估默认只读取当前活动结构；已删除结构不在本次范围内。"
msgstr ""
"If no data is loaded, NepTrainKit asks you to open a dataset first. The "
"audit covers the active structures only; structures already removed from the"
" dataset are outside the audit scope."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:18
#: 54d1978fec7744d7914bcda70923c82a
msgid "数据变化后要重新检查"
msgstr "Re-run the audit after the data changes"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:20
#: 5244a192130849d298340a37c56686ff
msgid ""
"页面顶部会显示结构范围、数据指纹和生成时间。删除结构、切换数据、修改标签或切换 `nep.txt` "
"后，请点击「重新检查」。旧结果不能继续代表已经变化的数据。"
msgstr ""
"The header records the audited structure range, data fingerprint, and "
"generation time. Click `Re-run checks` after deleting structures, switching "
"datasets, editing labels, or changing `nep.txt`. An earlier result no longer"
" represents the modified data."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:23
#: 1ae98d139db0449083e1057ac32e66fb
msgid "推荐操作顺序"
msgstr "Recommended workflow"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:25
#: d566b3e44b2a4e4eabf735242c685b81
msgid "1. 先看「概览」"
msgstr "Step 1: Start with Overview"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:27
#: 94ea4fbedff9436ebb460b825c9fb392
msgid "「概览」先回答 3 个问题："
msgstr "The Overview answers three questions:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:29
#: 64466a44243248a99d043abcfd015261
msgid "有没有空结构、非法数值、标签形状错误等训练阻塞项；"
msgstr ""
"Are there empty structures, non-finite values, invalid label shapes, or "
"other training blockers?"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:30
#: 72f6db7f3ca747b7ba9f21fa57d48e30
msgid "当前数据包含哪些精确组分、元素和标签；"
msgstr "Which exact compositions, elements, and labels are present?"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:31
#: 0a15dd7926304949a7c1540e23891023
msgid "哪些高力、高能量、重复或低频集合值得先复核。"
msgstr ""
"Which high-force, high-energy, repeated, or low-frequency groups deserve "
"review first?"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:33
#: 98d3d9b712cd470c97c81556770afecb
msgid "点击复核项后，下方会显示观察事实、解释和能力边界。再点击显示结构按钮，即可返回原页面，并选中该项对应的真实结构。"
msgstr ""
"Select a review topic to see the observation, interpretation, and capability"
" boundary. Use the structure button to return to `NEP Dataset Display` with "
"the affected structures selected."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:35
#: a7ae51cba48b46fcafcb3e9cc38b76b2
msgid "训练集评估概览页，标出当前结论、数据概况、建议复核顺序和 HTML 报告导出入口"
msgstr ""
"Training Set Audit overview with the conclusion, dataset metrics, "
"recommended review order, and HTML export highlighted"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:35
#: a7ae51cba48b46fcafcb3e9cc38b76b2
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_overview.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:40
#: f2b6ca11e715491f938f8d67fd9faa54
msgid ""
"图中的编号就是推荐阅读顺序：先读当前结论，再确认本次检查了多少结构和标签，随后按「建议下一步」进入复核队列。只有需要留档或发给合作者时，才使用右上角的 "
"HTML 导出。"
msgstr ""
"Follow the numbered reading order in the screenshot: read the current "
"conclusion, confirm how many structures and labels were checked, then use "
"Recommended next steps to enter the review queue. Export HTML only when you "
"need a durable record or a report for a collaborator."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:42
#: d5d79373769e42d8be5e44267e8a95d8
msgid "2. 在「数据地图」查看组分、相和磁类型"
msgstr "Step 2: Inspect composition, structural phase, and magnetic type in Data map"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:44
#: 043386637a75498c89281021fa493457
msgid ""
"「组分地图」按精确原子比例合并结构。例如，`Fe2Ni2`、`Fe4Ni4` 和 `Fe32Ni32` 都归入同一个 `Fe:Ni = 1:1` "
"组分点。右侧表格仍保留结构数量、原子数和 `Config_type`，不会把不同尺寸的结构当成同一个结构。"
msgstr ""
"The composition map groups structures by exact atomic ratio. For example, "
"`Fe2Ni2`, `Fe4Ni4`, and `Fe32Ni32` all belong to the same `Fe:Ni = 1:1` "
"composition point. The table still records the number of structures, atom "
"counts, and `Config_type`, so structures with different cell sizes are not "
"treated as the same geometry."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:46
#: 80c09b86bd784b19b4c5f92d5c0ca1ca
msgid "第一次进入时，柱高表示该浓度下的结构数。点击「分析相结构与磁序」后，页面会遍历当前评估范围内的所有结构，并增加两种视图："
msgstr ""
"Initially, each bar shows the number of structures at that concentration. "
"Click `Analyze phases and magnetic order` to traverse every structure in the"
" audit scope and enable two additional evidence views:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:48
#: b6dcdb3c4dc44f239ba3ee5dca404b41
msgid "**结构相：** FCC、HCP、BCC、L1₂、C14 Laves、C15 Laves、混合局域结构和未解析；"
msgstr ""
"**Structural phase:** FCC, HCP, BCC, L1₂, C14 Laves, C15 Laves, mixed local "
"structure, and unresolved;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:49
#: d30818cc1abf4109b3ea337f646f11f7
msgid "**磁类型：** FM、AFM（未细分）、逐层 AFM（`↑↓`）、双层 AFM（`↑↑↓↓`）、FiM、PM-like（自旋无序）、其他非共线、未识别、低／零磁矩和无有效 `spin` 字段。"
msgstr ""
"**Magnetic type:** FM, AFM (unsubtyped), layered AFM (`↑↓`), double-layer "
"AFM (`↑↑↓↓`), FiM, PM-like (spin-disordered), other noncollinear, "
"unresolved, low/zero moment, and no valid `spin` field."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:51
#: f4712e13b1494d418274a174d972c57c
msgid "分析结束后，可以先选组分，再用结构相和磁类型下拉框继续筛选。点击「查看选中的结构」即可回到 `NEP Dataset Display`。"
msgstr ""
"When analysis finishes, select a composition and refine it with the "
"structural-phase and magnetic-type filters. Click `Show selected "
"structures` to return to `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:53
#: 93e9c1baa001465cb63d1fc0679b78fc
msgid "相和磁是两条独立证据。同一个 FCC 或 BCC 骨架可以承载不同磁结构，所以页面不会把它们合成一个不可拆分的标签。`Config_type` 只是来源元数据，不参与结构相或磁类型判断。"
msgstr ""
"Structural phase and magnetism are independent evidence layers. The same "
"FCC or BCC framework can carry different magnetic structures, so the "
"interface does not collapse them into a single inseparable label. "
"`Config_type` is source metadata only and does not participate in structural-"
"phase or magnetic-type classification."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 17bf302dfb28404bbdceb2817adadedf
msgid "在「进阶证据 → 磁序」中还可以切换三张按结构帧数归一化的 100% 堆叠图：每个结构相中的磁类型占比、每个磁类型中的结构相占比，以及整个评估范围的磁类型占比。颜色段中的百分比和右侧帧数分别回答“占多少”和“有多少帧”；点击任一颜色段可回选对应结构。"
msgstr "Under `Advanced evidence → Magnetic order`, switch among three 100% stacked charts normalized by structure-frame count: magnetic-type shares within each structural phase, structural-phase shares within each magnetic type, and magnetic-type shares across the full audit scope. Percentages inside colored segments show the share, counts at the right show the number of frames, and clicking a segment selects its structures."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:57
#: 277da8a81e1d460dbf8e119e9b9d388b
msgid "训练集评估的磁类型占比视图，显示图表切换、结构帧占比、颜色图例和结构回选入口"
msgstr "Magnetic-type share view with chart switching, structure-frame percentages, a color legend, and the structure-selection action"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:57
#: 277da8a81e1d460dbf8e119e9b9d388b
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_magnetic_shares.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 892a6ae6ab4e496ca9878d72b8ad3376
msgid "训练集评估的组分地图，标出证据层切换、相分布柱图、精确组分表和结构回选控件"
msgstr ""
"Composition map with controls for evidence-layer selection, phase-colored "
"bars, exact-composition groups, and sending structures back to Dataset "
"Display"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 892a6ae6ab4e496ca9878d72b8ad3376
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/training_set_audit_structure_map.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:60
#: bfa84f828bee4b7ba813f0551a33e1ca
msgid ""
"上图使用的示例数据只有一个 `Pb:Te = 1:1` 精确组分点，而且 a-CNA 没有把它强行归入 FCC、HCP、BCC "
"或内置有序相，因此柱子显示为灰色「未解析」。这不是程序出错，而是「当前几何证据不足以给出这些标签」。如果数据带有有效 "
"`spin:R:3`，右上角证据层还会出现「按磁序着色」，下方磁序筛选框也会启用。"
msgstr ""
"The example above contains a single exact `Pb:Te = 1:1` composition point. "
"a-CNA does not force this geometry into FCC, HCP, BCC, or one of the built-"
"in ordered-phase templates, so the bar is gray and labeled unresolved. This "
"is not an analysis failure: it means the current geometric evidence is "
"insufficient for those labels. With valid `spin:R:3` data, a magnetic-order "
"coloring option appears in the evidence selector and the magnetic filter "
"becomes available."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:62
#: 21e2b1c5fe0d49cd9aab5f9f55d4213c
msgid "3. 用「进阶证据」追到局域环境"
msgstr "Step 3: Trace local environments in Advanced evidence"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:64
#: 4ecd72e6b9554772a0f1180bf0aca657
msgid "有活动的 `nep.txt` 时，页面会读取模型声明的元素及径向、角向 cutoff，并按模型实际可见的邻域统计："
msgstr ""
"With an active `nep.txt`, the audit reads the model elements and "
"radial/angular cutoffs, then measures the neighborhoods that the model can "
"actually see:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:66
#: 51761a611e904d94a8992beb4c1fa98e
msgid "中心元素周围的配位数和近邻元素组成；"
msgstr ""
"coordination numbers and neighboring-element composition around each central"
" element;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:67
#: 42a955e90d054366a778852dee0abf96
msgid "元素对是否共同出现、是否在 cutoff 内真正接触；"
msgstr ""
"whether element pairs merely coexist or actually come into contact inside "
"the cutoff;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:68
#: 5f10f9cf918c4290963b72c16990402f
msgid "标签分布、高力尾部和高能量尾部。"
msgstr "label distributions, the high-force tail, and the high-energy tail."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:70
#: 8c329ebb7a624f639992f14e273da37a
msgid "没有 `nep.txt` 时，数据质量、组分、标签、结构相和磁类型仍可使用；依赖模型 cutoff 的局域化学与元素对接触会显示为不可用。"
msgstr ""
"Without `nep.txt`, data quality, composition, labels, structural phase, and "
"magnetic type remain available. Local-chemistry and element-pair contact "
"checks that require model cutoffs are marked unavailable."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:72
#: 168b7783eb834e96928d0e28b76c1b4b
msgid "4. 在「复核队列」记录判断"
msgstr "Step 4: Record decisions in Review queue"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:74
#: cee429f1f4f04af4b0df9524958b6bba
msgid "「复核队列」把相关的低频分箱合并为一个主题，避免同一问题产生大量重复提醒。状态选项会随问题类型变化：阻塞项可标为「未解决」或「已解决并重新检查」，重复几何可标记为「有意保留」「隔离候选」或「需要重算」，普通复核项可标记为「物理上合理」或「检查几何」。这些状态用于当前数据快照的页面复核，不会自动删除或修改结构。"
msgstr ""
"The Review queue combines related low-frequency bins into one topic instead "
"of producing many alerts for the same issue. Available states depend on the "
"finding: blockers can be marked unresolved or resolved and rechecked; "
"repeated geometries can be intentionally retained, isolated as candidates, "
"or sent for recalculation; ordinary review groups can be marked physically "
"expected or scheduled for geometry inspection. These states document the "
"review of the current snapshot. They do not delete or modify structures."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:76
#: 00057f74063f486bb3c724edbd119efa
msgid "5. 有明确研究范围时再用「目标与模型」"
msgstr "Step 5: Use Target & model only after defining the research scope"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:78
#: edf7b27e0d6f4d4ca7f2946653638858
msgid "目标比较只在用户明确给出目标后才成立。可以指定："
msgstr ""
"A target comparison is meaningful only after the user declares a target. You"
" can specify:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:80
#: 6663531a2dba4e81825af56ffb83ee35
msgid "一个元素的浓度范围；"
msgstr "a concentration range for one element;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:81
#: 369f5300505a44b28e0f12e5b618f755
msgid "必须出现的浓度点；"
msgstr "required concentration points;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:82
#: 63394c508c41425dbe8f53ed88f3de33
msgid "必须出现的 `Config_type`；"
msgstr "required `Config_type` values;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:83
#: 64bb115fd6f54354b3df9d946127df18
msgid "每个点的最少结构数。"
msgstr "a minimum structure count at each point."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:85
#: 433d41a14a524eb7b457bca27a424227
msgid "页面比较的是**精确组分点和结构数量规则**。即使某个点显示为「支持」，也只表示数量规则通过，不代表局域环境、温压路径、缺陷类型或模型精度已经覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"The comparison evaluates **exact composition points and structure-count "
"rules**. A point marked supported has passed those count rules only; it does"
" not prove coverage of local environments, temperature-pressure paths, "
"defect types, or model accuracy."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:87
#: 5e63620becc24f198008aee5b0e00235
msgid "当前训练数据上的 Show NEP 预测可以用于浏览误差，但不会自动视为独立模型验证。要判断泛化误差，仍需结构映射和单位已经核对的独立参考值与预测值。"
msgstr ""
"Show NEP predictions on the current training data are useful for browsing "
"errors, but they are not automatically treated as independent model "
"validation. Generalization error requires separately mapped reference and "
"prediction values with verified units."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:89
#: 12d49f612a0842338f657b2cef5dc145
msgid "快速体检检查什么"
msgstr "What the quick audit checks"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:91
#: 8029544d286d47ef95a1ee6405935a12
msgid "训练阻塞项"
msgstr "Training blockers"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:93
#: fb2c0454cf644d2ba660a47c03b5475d
msgid "以下结果违反明确的数据契约，应在训练前处理："
msgstr ""
"The following results violate explicit data contracts and should be resolved"
" before training:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:95
#: 201e22212b5d4ec0b3183c27c5dd8ad1
msgid "空结构；"
msgstr "empty structures;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:96
#: 68993afe065a4505981ba3c2d22bd65a
msgid "位置、晶胞或标签中的 `NaN / Inf`；"
msgstr "`NaN / Inf` in positions, cells, or labels;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:97
#: 8f8d18ac411748aab21e655145f4cdcd
msgid "位置、力、virial 等数组形状错误；"
msgstr "invalid array shapes for positions, forces, virial, or related fields;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:98
#: 0fb66ca914fe4e30a3779537b8a8811b
msgid "周期方向与晶胞不一致；"
msgstr "periodic directions that are inconsistent with the cell;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:99
#: 74dc14364d9f4be3a6bf8dcb5fd590d1
msgid "未知元素，或元素数量与原子数不一致；"
msgstr "unknown elements, or an element count that does not match the atom count;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:100
#: 5bb93f42c204413b9a83936793e42120
msgid "最短原子距离小于 `0.5 Å` 的保守重叠信号；"
msgstr ""
"a conservative overlap signal when the shortest interatomic distance is "
"below `0.5 Å`;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:101
#: a669c90f899a473cb3016501818d1fe3
msgid "相同几何对应互相冲突的能量、力或 virial 标签。"
msgstr ""
"identical geometries with mutually inconsistent energy, force, or virial "
"labels."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:103
#: 9b00c04a73ea421288390a7ab30ce220
msgid ""
"相同几何按元素、周期边界、晶胞和坐标共同判断；晶胞与坐标比较到小数点后 8 位。冲突标签的当前绝对容差为：能量 `1 × 10⁻⁵`、力 `1 × "
"10⁻⁵`、virial `1 × 10⁻⁴`，相对容差为 `0`。"
msgstr ""
"Geometry identity includes elements, periodic boundaries, cell, and "
"coordinates; cells and coordinates are rounded to eight decimal places for "
"comparison. Current absolute tolerances for conflicting labels are `1 × "
"10⁻⁵` for energy, `1 × 10⁻⁵` for force, and `1 × 10⁻⁴` for virial, with zero"
" relative tolerance."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:105
#: b1dcde8083e947e2bc5b380b515e906e
msgid "软件不会自动删除阻塞结构，也不会替用户决定哪一次重复计算才正确。应先回到结构来源和 DFT 输出核对。"
msgstr ""
"NepTrainKit does not delete blocking structures or decide which repeated "
"calculation is correct. Check the structure provenance and original DFT "
"output first."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:107
#: 1de13e3760694b7e94795cc6d7550923
msgid "建议复核项"
msgstr "Recommended review groups"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:109
#: 3c61e64aee924aeaa5ca37cff1facf0f
msgid "最大力最高的 10%；"
msgstr "the highest 10% by maximum force;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:110
#: 09a4e668e6404322b6e5010ca16e6736
msgid "单原子能量最高的 5%；"
msgstr "the highest 5% by energy per atom;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:111
#: 7a5fac658fa74f549bc7fb84e4b496eb
msgid "重复几何；"
msgstr "repeated geometries;"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:112
#: 6fc2d34a1eb842d2ae3b96d335343375
msgid "当前数据内部的低频组分、低频局域环境或不平衡集合。"
msgstr ""
"low-frequency compositions, local environments, or imbalanced groups inside "
"the current dataset."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:114
#: a56b30fffd754de0b1143205909b28f1
msgid "固定分位集合按排名必然产生。高力、高能量或重复结构可能来自真实目标物理、显式加权或独立计算，因此这些结果是复核入口，不是删除建议。"
msgstr ""
"Rank-based percentile groups exist by construction. High-force, high-energy,"
" or repeated structures may represent intended physics, explicit weighting, "
"or independent calculations. Treat these findings as review entry points, "
"not deletion recommendations."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:116
#: cc9ba17d6e3541f0bd1ae8a87a63adb9
msgid "结构相如何识别"
msgstr "How structural phases are identified"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:118
#: a792738fb7234cecac22361365f5b766
msgid "FCC、HCP 和 BCC：自适应公共近邻分析"
msgstr "FCC, HCP, and BCC: adaptive common-neighbor analysis"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:120
#: 1b5ae4ed2c374fef880211d6f3c60948
msgid ""
"页面先对每个原子做自适应公共近邻分析（Adaptive Common Neighbor Analysis，a-CNA）。算法使用周期性近邻搜索，最多取得"
" 24 个近邻，并根据第一、第二近邻壳之间的距离间隔为每个原子单独确定 cutoff。"
msgstr ""
"The audit applies adaptive common-neighbor analysis (a-CNA) to each atom. A "
"periodic neighbor search collects up to 24 neighbors, then determines an "
"atom-specific cutoff from the gap between the first and second neighbor "
"shells."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:122
#: 1299e0823c8e4ced9db30fcc6298c5d3
#, python-brace-format
msgid "对于 FCC 和 HCP，设排好序的近邻距离为 $d_1 \\le \\cdots \\le d_{13}$。只有在"
msgstr ""
"For FCC and HCP, let the sorted neighbor distances be $d_1 \\le \\cdots \\le"
" d_{13}$. Only when"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:124
#: 63da2a42dfb747a683a32e894cd6f1de
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{d_{13}}{d_{12}} \\ge 1.08\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:128
#: 11f269b0802e45e79c0fb9fd7af35702
msgid "时，才用"
msgstr "does the analysis use"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:130
#: 82f559207afa44a0b3602782e04488d6
msgid ""
"\n"
"r_\\mathrm{cut}=\\frac{d_{12}+d_{13}}{2}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:134
#: ba99d301dc254e9a98ecee0614e998d8
msgid "分隔 12 配位的第一近邻壳。随后统计每条中心—近邻键的 3 个 CNA 数：公共近邻数、公共近邻之间的键数、最长键链长度。理想拓扑对应："
msgstr ""
"to separate the 12-fold first-neighbor shell. Each center-neighbor bond is "
"then described by three CNA values: the number of common neighbors, the "
"number of bonds among those common neighbors, and the longest bond-chain "
"length. The ideal topologies are:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 2cfbad8c3e484a49b460dd2a372fb241
msgid "局域结构"
msgstr "Local structure"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 8345974a5ad947ccb4f1fe5512be8063
msgid "CNA 组合"
msgstr "CNA signature"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: dd9aa3a3820a40759c56df30a970e3c7
msgid "FCC"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 97eaed87d4c24533a2371185f9973b41
msgid "12 条 `(4, 2, 1)`"
msgstr "12 bonds of `(4, 2, 1)`"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 780e0822092d4e07a80b02e5aeb8ba72
msgid "HCP"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 9179d9ccac144f1fbe6755e081a272c8
msgid "6 条 `(4, 2, 1)` + 6 条 `(4, 2, 2)`"
msgstr "6 bonds of `(4, 2, 1)` + 6 bonds of `(4, 2, 2)`"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 85cedc9451e34b9480f99e4e491f2187
msgid "BCC"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: c08ff4cb26c04b00a1e0efc36a229098
msgid "6 条 `(4, 4, 3)` + 8 条 `(6, 6, 5)`"
msgstr "6 bonds of `(4, 4, 3)` + 8 bonds of `(6, 6, 5)`"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:142
#: 386faa00c76b44c195fa61dd617c3a29
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"BCC 使用前 14 个近邻，并要求 $d_{15}/d_{14} \\ge "
"1.08$。不满足壳层间隔或拓扑组合的原子记为「未解析」，不会强行分到最接近的晶相。"
msgstr ""
"BCC uses the first 14 neighbors and requires $d_{15}/d_{14} \\ge 1.08$. "
"Atoms that fail the shell-gap or topology tests are labeled unresolved "
"rather than forced into the nearest crystal class."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:144
#: 9e0402b9a3804e40995ba626ee78c23a
msgid "对一帧结构，某种局域相的原子占比为"
msgstr "For a structure, the fraction of atoms assigned to local phase $\\alpha$ is"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:146
#: 6794b0ff02dc4a4687b4bbd5c2378c9a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"p_\\alpha=\\frac{N_\\alpha}{N}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:150
#: 8cbf6a7dc61645f1a8e00458c727c75f
msgid ""
"若没有更具体的有序相通过确认，$p_\\alpha \\ge 0.80$ 时结构记为强证据；$0.50 \\le p_\\alpha < 0.80$ "
"时记为混合证据；低于 `0.50` 时记为未解析。这些比例描述当前快照中的局域拓扑，不等同于热力学相分数。"
msgstr ""
"Unless a more specific ordered phase has been confirmed, $p_\\alpha \\ge "
"0.80$ is strong structural evidence, $0.50 \\le p_\\alpha < 0.80$ is mixed "
"evidence, and a value below `0.50` is unresolved. These fractions describe "
"local topology in the saved snapshot; they are not thermodynamic phase "
"fractions."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:152
#: 4f214f01f21243548d661cb2b86689be
msgid "L1₂ 与 Laves：几何和化学同时过门槛"
msgstr "L1₂ and Laves phases: geometry and chemistry must both pass"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:154
#: 71d337bcdb1d452ab3a925fef935da0b
msgid "L1₂、C14 和 C15 不能只靠 FCC/HCP/BCC 局域几何区分。页面只对二元结构做保守确认，并同时检查组成、局域形状和化学占位。"
msgstr ""
"L1₂, C14, and C15 cannot be distinguished using FCC/HCP/BCC local geometry "
"alone. The audit applies conservative confirmation to binary structures and "
"requires composition, local shape, and chemical occupation to agree."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:156
#: 254f04f1d51843518807c6632c6dbc3b
msgid "局域形状首先消除整体尺度。对选定的 $K$ 个近邻，以平均近邻距离 $\\bar r$ 归一化，构造"
msgstr ""
"The local-shape comparison first removes the overall length scale. For the "
"selected $K$ neighbors, distances are normalized by their mean $\\bar r$ to "
"construct"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:158
#: 9ab3cc4004e64b15907b696d2a436872
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf d=\\operatorname{sort}\\left(\\frac{r_i}{\\bar r}\\right)\n"
"\\oplus\n"
"\\operatorname{sort}\\left(\\frac{\\lVert\\mathbf r_i-\\mathbf "
"r_j\\rVert}{\\bar r}\\right)_{i<j}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:164
#: 251595dec326447fa1271b508675a82a
msgid ""
"这里 $\\oplus$ "
"表示把两组数连接起来。程序计算该描述向量与内置参考晶体模板之间的最小均方根距离。这样可以容忍整体缩放和适度畸变，但不会仅凭晶格常数认相。"
msgstr ""
"Here $\\oplus$ concatenates the two sorted sets. The audit computes the "
"minimum root-mean-square distance between this descriptor and built-in "
"reference-crystal templates. The normalization tolerates uniform scaling and"
" moderate distortion, but the classifier does not assign a phase from the "
"lattice constant alone."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:166
#: bb9d97c1887843e39f4fbf4c119243b6
msgid ""
"**L1₂：** 自动识别接近 `A:B = 1:3` 的二元组成。除了 FCC 形状外，还要求 A 位点的前 12 个近邻中没有 A、第二壳 6 "
"个近邻全为 A；B 位点的前 12 个近邻中有 4 个 A、第二壳没有 A。几何匹配比例至少为 `0.80`，化学匹配比例至少为 "
"`0.85`，几何与化学同时匹配的比例至少为 `0.80`。"
msgstr ""
"**L1₂:** identify a binary composition close to `A:B = 1:3`. In addition to "
"an FCC-like shape, an A site must have no A atoms among its first 12 "
"neighbors and six A atoms in the second shell; a B site must have four A "
"atoms in the first 12 neighbors and no A atoms in the second shell. At least"
" `0.80` of sites must pass geometry, `0.85` must pass chemistry, and `0.80` "
"must pass both."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:167
#: 2a2f0d05807645e1992718feb52afbe8
msgid ""
"**Laves：** 自动识别接近 `A:B = 1:2` 的二元组成。A 位点按 Z16 模板检查，B 位点按 Z12 模板检查；A 位点应有 4 个"
" A 近邻，B 位点应有 6 个 A 近邻。几何匹配和联合匹配比例都至少为 `0.85`。通过后再用 B 子晶格的中心对称参数区分 C14 与 C15。"
msgstr ""
"**Laves:** identify a binary composition close to `A:B = 1:2`. A sites are "
"checked against a Z16 template and B sites against a Z12 template. An A site"
" should have four A neighbors and a B site should have six A neighbors. Both"
" the geometry pass fraction and the joint geometry-and-chemistry fraction "
"must be at least `0.85`. C14 and C15 are then separated using the "
"centrosymmetry parameter of the B sublattice."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:169
#: f8e2e44067814637b7451ef4adbbe4b3
msgid ""
"自动推断 A/B 角色时，实际组成与理想少数元素比例的偏差必须不超过 `3.5%`。C36 局域堆垛与 C14/C15 "
"混合在当前局域证据下可能不可区分，因此只显示为未确认线索，不会作为已确认 C36 输出。这里的「未确认」表示证据不足，不表示该相一定不存在。"
msgstr ""
"When A/B roles are inferred automatically, the actual minority-element "
"fraction must be within `3.5%` of the ideal composition. C36 local stacking "
"can be indistinguishable from mixed C14/C15 under the current local "
"evidence, so it is reported only as an unconfirmed signal rather than a "
"confirmed C36 label. Unconfirmed means insufficient evidence, not proof that"
" the phase is absent."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:171
#: 13618249aa594b228b6283df0e880ae7
msgid "磁类型如何识别"
msgstr "How magnetic types are identified"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:173
#: 9ef27a19efbf44309611cde3c70034a3
msgid "输入条件"
msgstr "Input requirement"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:175
#: 83de5186a6f1405c8757ec07813f6154
msgid "磁类型分析只读取逐原子的 `spin:R:3`，即每个原子一个三分量自旋向量："
msgstr ""
"Magnetic-type analysis reads only per-atom `spin:R:3`: one three-component spin "
"vector for each atom."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:177
#: f67d63dd0e8d47719084716e759c3a97
msgid "Properties=species:S:1:pos:R:3:spin:R:3\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:181
#: 0031d601a3b7460894a88b7ae1513c4e
msgid ""
"`spin` 必须是数值型 `N × 3` 数组，并且所有分量有限。`mforce` 和 `force_mag` 是磁力标签，不能替代 "
"`spin`。缺少有效 `spin` 的结构会单独显示为「无有效 spin 字段」，不会被猜成非磁结构。"
msgstr ""
"`spin` must be a numeric `N × 3` array with finite components. `mforce` and "
"`force_mag` are magnetic-force labels and cannot replace `spin`. A structure"
" without valid `spin` data is reported as having no valid spin field; it is "
"not guessed to be nonmagnetic."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:183
#: 58e32798caa746dba64587c67539a49b
msgid "4 组判据"
msgstr "Four groups of observables"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:185
#: cc1807f6e40747eab9ce0a55946f8eac
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"设第 $i$ 个自旋为 $\\mathbf s_i$，磁矩大小为 $m_i=\\lVert\\mathbf s_i\\rVert$，单位方向为 "
"$\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i=\\mathbf s_i/m_i$。小于等于 `1 × 10⁻⁷` 的磁矩不参与方向统计。"
msgstr ""
"Let the spin on atom $i$ be $\\mathbf s_i$, its magnitude be "
"$m_i=\\lVert\\mathbf s_i\\rVert$, and its unit direction be $\\hat{\\mathbf "
"s}_i=\\mathbf s_i/m_i$. Moments at or below `1 × 10⁻⁷` are excluded from "
"directional statistics."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:187
#: 1011c9d95d2b45f6908d966e1e3a4501
msgid "**净磁矩比例**"
msgstr "**Net-moment ratio**"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:189
#: 4b44d154df0240e9abd6fbbca3d65e00
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"   R_M=\\frac{\\left\\lVert\\sum_i\\mathbf "
"s_i\\right\\rVert}{\\sum_i\\lVert\\mathbf s_i\\rVert}\n"
"   "
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:193
#: d6149c4422c0480aaa4d60bf6a8b84b2
msgid "$R_M$ 接近 `1` 表示自旋净对齐，接近 `0` 表示整体补偿。它是无量纲比例；平均磁矩仍沿用输入 `spin` 的单位。"
msgstr ""
"$R_M$ near `1` indicates net alignment, while a value near `0` indicates "
"global compensation. The ratio is dimensionless; the mean moment retains the"
" unit of the input `spin` vectors."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:195
#: 68cb00d2de6345d795a4b300256f40a6
msgid "**共线性与共面性**"
msgstr "**Collinearity and coplanarity**"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:197
#: f4b681cb63c14b0c93eb837510036f7f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"   \\mathbf Q=\\frac{1}{N_s}\\sum_i\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i\\hat{\\mathbf "
"s}_i^{\\mathsf T},\n"
"   \\qquad \\lambda_1\\le\\lambda_2\\le\\lambda_3\n"
"   "
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:202
#: 7ecdcd628481469aa45787ae2713aae2
msgid ""
"共线性取 $C=\\lambda_3$，共面性取 $P=1-3\\lambda_1$。$C$ 接近 `1` 表示方向集中在同一条轴上；$P$ 接近 "
"`1` 表示方向主要位于同一平面。"
msgstr ""
"Collinearity is $C=\\lambda_3$ and coplanarity is $P=1-3\\lambda_1$. A value"
" of $C$ near `1` means the directions concentrate around one axis; $P$ near "
"`1` means the directions lie mainly in one plane."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:204
#: 74bcb9d561f84c20944ff93d87dbd3ce
msgid "**近邻自旋相关**"
msgstr "**Neighbor spin correlation**"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:206
#: be37f8274eb847d0ac63b636a4a9d6fd
msgid "每个原子最多取 12 个最近邻，计算"
msgstr "For each atom, the audit takes up to 12 nearest neighbors and computes"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:208
#: 016bbfd1db0c4e79bbb4e25722103110
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"   \\bar c=\\left\\langle\\hat{\\mathbf s}_i\\cdot\\hat{\\mathbf "
"s}_j\\right\\rangle_{\\langle i,j\\rangle}\n"
"   "
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:212
#: bbb6e1fb80264674af0447b07ecb0f43
msgid "点积不小于 `0.80` 记为平行近邻，不大于 `-0.80` 记为反平行近邻。程序还分别统计平行和反平行近邻比例。"
msgstr ""
"A dot product of at least `0.80` counts as a parallel neighbor, while a "
"value at or below `-0.80` counts as antiparallel. The parallel and "
"antiparallel neighbor fractions are also recorded."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:214
#: 4f9031dc66d64feaa17fcf835d92b99a
msgid "**低阶磁结构因子**"
msgstr "**Low-order magnetic structure factor**"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:216
#: 658fea072b8c4a8dbf96a1b9f6ec4527
msgid "对分数坐标 $\\mathbf f_i$，程序在周期方向上扫描 $|h|,|k|,|l|\\le3$ 的非零整数波矢，计算"
msgstr ""
"For fractional coordinates $\\mathbf f_i$, the audit scans nonzero integer "
"wave vectors with $|h|,|k|,|l|\\le3$ along periodic directions and computes"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:218
#: fd0c5dde99be4bc3915f739c0cb34d46
msgid ""
"\n"
"   S(\\mathbf q)=\\min\\!\\left[1,\n"
"   \\frac{2\\left\\lVert\\sum_i\\mathbf s_i\n"
"   \\exp\\!\\left(\\mathrm i2\\pi\\mathbf q\\cdot\\mathbf "
"f_i\\right)\\right\\rVert^2}\n"
"   {\\left(\\sum_i m_i\\right)^2}\\right]\n"
"   "
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:225
#: 0146439fb8a84d0894439f6c95ba7684
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"页面记录最大值 $S_\\mathrm{max}$ 及对应的整数波矢。它用于识别当前超胞内可分辨的低阶调制，不是连续 reciprocal-space "
"扫描。"
msgstr ""
"The page records the maximum $S_\\mathrm{max}$ and its integer wave vector. "
"This detects low-order modulation that the current supercell can represent; "
"it is not a continuous reciprocal-space scan."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:227
#: 9e39cb50b15442eb8123ccbdacdc073b
msgid "结构级磁类型标签"
msgstr "Structure-level magnetic-type labels"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:229
#: 239ad874095a4254a0cdb040b58a2337
msgid "判定按下表从上到下执行："
msgstr "The first matching rule in the following table is used:"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 8f7597f30ac84d52b830c81d61213417
msgid "输出"
msgstr "Output label"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: 95a9ae11238546ee800074ca6623db7c
msgid "当前判据"
msgstr "Current criterion"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:55
#: a0712cdde9e04f2b88b7b3c462e3ee8b
msgid "低／零磁矩"
msgstr "Low / zero moment"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:57
#: 6446cf8afa234c14a2102d49052a3fea
