#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:258
#: 426608c950264fbc8f4e449063b56b9f
msgid "只有结构级结果已经属于 AFM，程序才继续检查层序。它沿周期晶格方向用分数坐标聚合磁层；同一方向上分数坐标间隔不超过 `0.025` 的原子归入同一层，层内极化绝对值必须至少为 `0.80`。层序细分至少需要 4 个有效磁矩原子。一个完整的周期 `↑↓` 标为「逐层 AFM」，`↑↑↓↓` 标为「双层 AFM」。周期边界会继续重复该层序，因此不要求同一晶胞内再出现第二遍。没有通过层序门槛的 AFM 显示为「AFM（未细分）」。"
msgstr "The program checks layer sequences only after the structure-level result is AFM. It groups atoms whose fractional-coordinate separation along the same periodic direction is at most `0.025` into one magnetic layer and requires an absolute within-layer polarization of at least `0.80`. Subtype recognition requires at least four atoms with valid moments. One complete `↑↓` period is labeled layered AFM, while `↑↑↓↓` is labeled double-layer AFM. Periodic boundaries repeat the sequence, so a second copy inside the same cell is unnecessary. AFM structures that do not pass the layer-sequence gate are shown as AFM (unsubtyped)."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:242
#: 76337b4e7d55403591ed9adac63c694b
msgid ""
"逐元素结果使用相同的净磁矩、方向张量、同元素近邻相关和结构因子，给出「对齐」「补偿」「调制」「非共线」「混合共线」「无序」等快照标签。异元素近邻耦合按平均点积判断：不小于"
" `0.50` 为平行，不大于 `-0.50` 为反平行，其余为混合。"
msgstr ""
"Per-element results use the same net moment, direction tensor, same-element "
"neighbor correlation, and structure factor to label each snapshot as "
"aligned, compensated, modulated, noncollinear, mixed collinear, or "
"disordered. Neighboring unlike-element coupling is classified from the mean "
"dot product: at least `0.50` is parallel, at most `-0.50` is antiparallel, "
"and intermediate values are mixed."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:244
#: f2ba8086aca549029a49934ea5e6b11b
msgid "磁类型标签的边界"
msgstr "Limits of magnetic-type labels"

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:246
#: a3f175cf9c214c1ca7abde5a7940e111
msgid "这些标签描述单帧自旋快照，不是有限温度磁相判定。`PM-like` 只表示这一帧在当前判据下呈现低净磁矩、低 q 峰和弱近邻相关，不能据此声明热力学顺磁相。波矢扫描只覆盖当前超胞可表示的低阶整数点；非公度螺旋、更长周期调制、强缺陷结构或尺寸很小的结构可能落入「其他非共线」或「未识别」。判断相变温度、磁畴稳定性或自由能仍需要独立模拟和物理验证。"
msgstr ""
"These labels describe a single saved spin snapshot, not a finite-temperature "
"magnetic phase. PM-like means only that this frame has low net moment, a weak "
"q peak, and weak neighbor correlation under the current criteria; it does not "
"establish a thermodynamic paramagnetic phase. The wave-vector scan covers only "
"low-order integer points representable in the current supercell. Incommensurate "
"spirals, longer-period modulation, strongly defective structures, or very small "
"cells may be reported as other noncollinear or unresolved. Transition "
"temperatures, domain stability, and free energies require separate simulations "
"and physical validation."

#: ../../source/module/training-set-assessment.md:249
